1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,530
(Penny:)Come on, let's just
get this over with.

2
00:00:02,692 --> 00:00:03,932
"Let's get this over with."

3
00:00:04,094 --> 00:00:05,664
(Leonard:)Am I driving you
to the Cheesecake Factory,

4
00:00:05,829 --> 00:00:07,469
(Leonard:)or are we having sex?

5
00:00:09,165 --> 00:00:10,545
I'm just trying to lighten the mood.

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,270
(Penny:)-I know. Thank you.
-Sorry.

7
00:00:12,435 --> 00:00:14,035
(Penny:)It's just so humiliating.

8
00:00:14,204 --> 00:00:15,654
(Leonard:)So humiliating?

9
00:00:15,805 --> 00:00:17,375
(Leonard:)Am I driving you to
the Cheesecake Factory....?

10
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,520
(Penny:)I'm sorry.
I'll stop. I'll stop.

11
00:00:22,145 --> 00:00:24,815
(Leonard:)Come on, don't look so sad.
You never know what's gonna happen.

12
00:00:24,981 --> 00:00:26,291
(Leonard:)Maybe tonight will be great.

13
00:00:26,449 --> 00:00:28,189
(Penny:)Sweetie, I know you're trying
to make me feel better,

14
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:30,061
(Penny:)and I love you for that,
but it's making me feel worse,

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,670
(Penny:)and I kind of hate you.

16
00:00:34,724 --> 00:00:35,894
(Penny:)This isn't your car.

17
00:00:36,059 --> 00:00:38,509
(Leonard:)I know. I thought we'd take yours.

18
00:00:41,531 --> 00:00:42,701
(Penny:)I don't understand.

19
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,140
(Leonard:)It's nothing fancy,
but it'll get you to auditions,

20
00:00:46,302 --> 00:00:48,752
(Leonard:)and at least for now, you don't
have to go back to waitressing.

21
00:00:51,808 --> 00:00:53,378
(Penny:)I don't know what to say.

22
00:00:55,378 --> 00:00:56,858
(Leonard:)Don't say anything.

23
00:00:57,147 --> 00:00:59,027
(Penny:)Oh, my God.

